    "overview": "The approved dark-glass dashboard puts payment records, receiving destinations and merchant configuration in a compact workspace. Charcoal, translucent slate and mint carry the hierarchy; a restrained lavender material distinguishes receiving-wallet context. Manrope and tabular figures keep operational information readable.",
